data: {"candidates": [{"content": {"parts": [{"text": "**Sequencing the Numbers**\n\nI'm analyzing the user's request, focusing on identifying the pattern in the sequence: 2, 6, 12, 20, 30, ?. Understanding the need for reasoning alongside the answer is crucial. Currently, I'm exploring various mathematical operations that could be applied. I'm going to look for any mathematical operations that might describe how the numbers are added or multiplied.\n\n\n","thought": true}],"role": "model"},"index": 0,"safetyRatings": [{"category": "HARM_CATEGORY_SEXUALLY_EXPLICIT","probability": "NEGLIGIBLE"},{"category": "HARM_CATEGORY_HATE_SPEECH","probability": "NEGLIGIBLE"},{"category": "HARM_CATEGORY_HARASSMENT","probability": "NEGLIGIBLE"},{"category": "HARM_CATEGORY_DANGEROUS_CONTENT","probability": "NEGLIGIBLE"}]}],"usageMetadata": {"promptTokenCount": 34,"totalTokenCount": 104,"promptTokensDetails": [{"modality": "TEXT","tokenCount": 34}],"thoughtsTokenCount": 70,"serviceTier": "standard"},"modelVersion": "gemini-2.5-pro","responseId": "N7dxaoLECda-vdIP4fyR2A0"}

data: {"candidates": [{"content": {"parts": [{"text": "**Predicting the Progression**\n\nI've determined the next number in the sequence is 42.  The key was identifying the arithmetic progression of the first-level differences (4, 6, 8, 10). I've confirmed that the difference between each term increases consistently by 2. Therefore, to reach the answer, I added the next difference, 12, to the last number in the sequence, 30.\n\n\n","thought": true}],"role": "model"},"index": 0,"safetyRatings": [{"category": "HARM_CATEGORY_SEXUALLY_EXPLICIT","probability": "NEGLIGIBLE"},{"category": "HARM_CATEGORY_HATE_SPEECH","probability": "NEGLIGIBLE"},{"category": "HARM_CATEGORY_HARASSMENT","probability": "NEGLIGIBLE"},{"category": "HARM_CATEGORY_DANGEROUS_CONTENT","probability": "NEGLIGIBLE"}]}],"usageMetadata": {"promptTokenCount": 34,"totalTokenCount": 458,"promptTokensDetails": [{"modality": "TEXT","tokenCount": 34}],"thoughtsTokenCount": 424,"serviceTier": "standard"},"modelVersion": "gemini-2.5-pro","responseId": "N7dxaoLECda-vdIP4fyR2A0"}

data: {"candidates": [{"content": {"parts": [{"text": "**Formulating the Details**\n\nI'm now articulating the detailed answer, ensuring clarity and precision for the user. I've broken down the reasoning into discrete, easy-to-follow steps and I'm ready to present it. My focus is on making the solution and the thought process, as clear as possible.\n\n\n","thought": true}],"role": "model"},"index": 0,"safetyRatings": [{"category": "HARM_CATEGORY_SEXUALLY_EXPLICIT","probability": "NEGLIGIBLE"},{"category": "HARM_CATEGORY_HATE_SPEECH","probability": "NEGLIGIBLE"},{"category": "HARM_CATEGORY_HARASSMENT","probability": "NEGLIGIBLE"},{"category": "HARM_CATEGORY_DANGEROUS_CONTENT","probability": "NEGLIGIBLE"}]}],"usageMetadata": {"promptTokenCount": 34,"totalTokenCount": 740,"promptTokensDetails": [{"modality": "TEXT","tokenCount": 34}],"thoughtsTokenCount": 706,"serviceTier": "standard"},"modelVersion": "gemini-2.5-pro","responseId": "N7dxaoLECda-vdIP4fyR2A0"}

data: {"candidates": [{"content": {"parts": [{"text": "**Deriving the Formula**\n\nI'm now going deeper, formulating an algebraic representation of the sequence. I've successfully connected each term to its position, leading me to develop the formula `T(n) = n * (n + 1)`. I'm confident in the relationship between the term number and the value, which clarifies how to predict any term in the sequence.\n\n\n","thought": true}],"role": "model"},"index": 0,"safetyRatings": [{"category": "HARM_CATEGORY_SEXUALLY_EXPLICIT","probability": "NEGLIGIBLE"},{"category": "HARM_CATEGORY_HATE_SPEECH","probability": "NEGLIGIBLE"},{"category": "HARM_CATEGORY_HARASSMENT","probability": "NEGLIGIBLE"},{"category": "HARM_CATEGORY_DANGEROUS_CONTENT","probability": "NEGLIGIBLE"}]}],"usageMetadata": {"promptTokenCount": 34,"totalTokenCount": 1041,"promptTokensDetails": [{"modality": "TEXT","tokenCount": 34}],"thoughtsTokenCount": 1007,"serviceTier": "standard"},"modelVersion": "gemini-2.5-pro","responseId": "N7dxaoLECda-vdIP4fyR2A0"}

